---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Managed DPP Data Hosting & Vault | Zero-Knowledge Cloud | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Turnkey battery passport data hosting. Delegate EU compliance, PCF carbon calculation, GS1 resolver hosting, and multi-party ZKP verification to our sovereign EU cloud."
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-radial-gradient">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-accent-emerald uppercase tracking-widest bg-accent-emerald/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-accent-emerald/20">
          Turnkey Compliance Service
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-4 mb-6">
          Managed DPP Data Vault: Zero Infrastructure, 100% Peace of Mind
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Skip the expense, complexity, and ongoing maintenance of self-hosting. Entrust your battery passport data lifecycle to EU DPP Provider. We securely ingest supply chain materials, generate compliant GS1 digital links, and host high-availability EU sovereign resolver endpoints with guaranteed 99.99% uptime.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Key Pillars -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 my-16">
        
        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl">🔒</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Zero-Knowledge Proofs (ZKP)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Your material recipes, anode/cathode proprietary formulations, and purchase costs are mathematically shielded. Regulators and downstream buyers only see cryptographically verified compliance certificates.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl">🇪🇺</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Sovereign EU Cloud Infrastructure</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Hosted entirely within certified Frankfurt and Paris data centers. Fully compliant with GDPR, EU Data Act, and Gaia-X trust frameworks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
          <div class="text-3xl">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Instant Data Ingestion & Batch API</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Upload your product BOMs and test certificates via our secure Web Portal, standard Excel templates, or automated REST API webhooks. Passports go live instantly.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- How Managed Hosting Works Step-by-Step -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 my-16">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">How Managed DPP Hosting Works</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-xs">
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 relative">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-400">STEP 01</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2">Upload Data</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">Submit battery model specs, test reports (UN 38.3, CE), and bill of materials via web dashboard or API.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 relative">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-400">STEP 02</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2">Automated Audit & PCF</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">Our engine calculates lifecycle carbon footprint and audits 90+ mandatory EU 2023/1542 data points.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 relative">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-400">STEP 03</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2">GS1 QR Delivery</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">Download printable GS1 Digital Link QR vectors or connect laser-marking printers via direct API.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 relative">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-accent-emerald">STEP 04</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2">24/7 Sovereign Hosting</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">We maintain the global resolver, handle regulator verification requests, and update compliance over time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Get a Custom Data Hosting Proposal</h3>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-emerald to-accent-teal text-white font-bold text-sm hover:opacity-90">
          Book Managed Hosting Consultation &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
